CLASS zgk0612_cx_trading_exception DEFINITION PUBLIC
  INHERITING FROM cx_static_check

  FINAL
  CREATE PUBLIC .

  PUBLIC SECTION.
    INTERFACES if_t100_message.

    DATA message TYPE string READ-ONLY.

    METHODS constructor
      IMPORTING message TYPE string.

ENDCLASS.



CLASS zgk0612_cx_trading_exception IMPLEMENTATION.

  METHOD constructor ##ADT_SUPPRESS_GENERATION.
    super->constructor( ).
    me->message = message.
  ENDMETHOD.

ENDCLASS.